IMPORTANT FOR CONTRIBUTORS

This licence applies to this directory ONLY. The rest of the repository is
Apache-2.0 (code), CC BY 4.0 (art) and CC0/USGS (data in data/).

Do not copy rows out of this directory into data/*.csv. The ShareAlike term would
then attach to those files too, and the NonCommercial term would spread with them.
Keep the two sets apart and let the game load both.
